sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Srv as Server (status authority)
    participant Live as Live channel (Ch 63/66)
    participant FCM as FCM (Ch 49)
    participant SSOT as Order SSOT (Ch 3)
    participant Sync as Sync (Ch 32)

    User->>SSOT: open tracking (watching) -> startWatching
    SSOT->>Live: subscribe (low-latency status + driver, Ch 67)
    Srv-->>Live: Shipped -> SSOT update -> timeline + map
    User->>SSOT: leave screen -> stopWatching (close live channel, Ch 44)
    Srv-->>FCM: OutForDelivery (backgrounded) -> notification (Ch 50)
    FCM->>Sync: trigger sync pull
    Sync->>SSOT: authoritative status (self-heal, Ch 32)
    User->>Sync: reopen app -> sync -> current status
